ming 4+ MUBs for d=6, which may bias toward caution for other dimensions; d=4 is not open.\",\n        \"The previous stage feedback demands recomputation and exact arithmetic, which may bias toward over-verification rather than accepting known results.\"\n      ],\n      \"should_continue\": true\n    },\n    \"sections\": [],\n    \"answer\": {\n      \"status\": \"SOLVED\"\n    }\n  }\n}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5461,"completion_tokens":576,"total_tokens":6037,"cost":0.00053225,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.00053225,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.00027305,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0002592},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}